<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>What You Want</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">CORTIS</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">What You Want</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">3rAcN3CLeSrkhIZN8PHbwb</ttm:item><itunes:duration>03:14.000</itunes:duration></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:00.000" end="00:01.500">What You Want - CORTIS</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:00.400" end="00:01.900">词：Supreme Boi/Teezo Touchdown/Hiss Noise/Zach Fogarty/SEONGHYEON/Slush Puppy/"hitman" bang/MARTIN/KEONHO/JUHOON</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:01.290" end="00:02.790">曲：Supreme Boi/Teezo Touchdown/Hiss Noise/Zach Fogarty/SEONGHYEON/Slush Puppy/"hitman" bang/MARTIN/KEONHO/JUHOON</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:02.190" end="00:03.690">制作人：Supreme Boi/Hiss Noise/Zach Fogarty/Slush Puppy/"hitman" bang</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:03.200" end="00:04.700" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Supreme Boi/Teezo Touchdown/Hiss Noise/Zach Fogarty/SEONGHYEON/Slush Puppy/"hitman" bang/MARTIN/KEONHO/JUHOON)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:04.000" end="00:05.500">Synthesizer：Hiss Noise/Supreme Boi</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:04.800" end="00:06.300">Guitar：Zach Fogarty/Hiss Noise</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:05.600" end="00:07.100">Programming：Supreme Boi/Hiss Noise/Slush Puppy</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:06.400" end="00:07.900">Background Vocals：Teezo Touchdown/MARTIN/SEONGHYEON/JAMES/KEONHO/JUHOON</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:07.200" end="00:08.700">Vocal Arrangement：Supreme Boi/Hiss Noise</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:08.000" end="00:09.500">Recording Engineer：Hiss Noise @ Analog Lab/Supreme Boi @ supremeboi_kor</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:08.800" end="00:10.300">Andrew Keller @ Westlake Recording Studios (Assisted by Jonathan Lopez)/김수정 @ HYBE Studio/탁현관 @ HYBE Studio</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:09.600" end="00:11.100">Digital Editing：Hiss Noise</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:10.400" end="00:11.900">Mix Engineer：Matheus Braz @ Braz Sound</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:11.200" end="00:14.380">Crash Smash Rock Mash up</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:14.380" end="00:16.820">Ooh Take what you want</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:16.820" end="00:20.020">돈 멋 명예 Love and what?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:20.020" end="00:22.470">Ooh Take what you want</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:22.470" end="00:27.080">Life's too fast 뭘 더 참아 이젠 됐어</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:27.080" end="00:28.580">What you want?!</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:27.600" end="00:29.130">I want to see the whole world</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:29.130" end="00:32.650">도장 찍어 나의 passport</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:32.650" end="00:34.150">What you want?!</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:33.080" end="00:34.580">Well</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:33.230" end="00:38.290">이마에 피도 안 말랐을 때 계획한 행보</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:38.290" end="00:39.790">What you want?!</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:38.760" end="00:44.920">바라던 걸 찾아 집을 떠나 what we came for</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:44.920" end="00:48.060">Crash Smash Rock Mash up</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:48.060" end="00:50.530">Ooh Take what you want</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:50.530" end="00:53.680">돈 멋 명예 Love and what?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:53.680" end="00:56.800">Ooh Take what you want</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:56.800" end="00:59.650">적당히론 배가 차지 않아</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:59.650" end="01:02.460">들이켜 yuh 마치 하마</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:02.460" end="01:05.250">Smelling like a teen 마치 Nirvana</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:05.250" end="01:07.010">소리쳐 yuh cause we wanna</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:07.010" end="01:12.620">That's what we all looking for</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:12.620" end="01:18.230">That's what we all looking for</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:18.230" end="01:23.690">That's what we all looking for</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:23.690" end="01:25.570">That's what we all looking-</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:25.570" end="01:29.330">One Two Three For</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:29.330" end="01:34.390">난 걍 돌아갈 바엔 바로 넘어버려 담장</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:34.390" end="01:35.890">What you want?!</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:34.930" end="01:40.050">난 원해 다시 뛰게 할 무언갈 나의 심장</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:40.050" end="01:41.550">What you want?!</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:40.510" end="01:45.550">야밤 새벽 배송 같은 fresh song I need that</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:45.550" end="01:47.050">What you want?!</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:46.150" end="01:51.400">I want the whole world to wake up and realize</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:51.400" end="01:52.900">Some people want this</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:52.830" end="01:54.330">Some people want that</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:54.190" end="01:56.980">나도 똑같아 17년 평생</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:56.980" end="01:58.590">쫓았었던 Love</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:58.590" end="02:00.090">쫓았었던 Fame</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:59.830" end="02:03.490">So now I want the whole world to know my name</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:03.490" end="02:06.650">Crash Smash Rock Mash up</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:06.650" end="02:09.120">Ooh Take what you want</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:09.120" end="02:12.280">돈 멋 명예 Love and what?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:12.280" end="02:15.410">Ooh Take what you want</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:15.410" end="02:18.230">적당히론 배가 차지 않아</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:18.230" end="02:21.080">들이켜 yuh 마치 하마</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:21.080" end="02:23.810">Smelling like a teen 마치 Nirvana</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:23.810" end="02:25.610">소리쳐 yuh cause we wanna</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:25.610" end="02:31.240">That's what we all looking for</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:31.240" end="02:36.290">That's what we all looking for</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:36.290" end="02:42.290">That's what we all looking for</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:42.290" end="02:44.180">That's what we all looking-</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:44.180" end="02:48.180">One Two Three For</p></div></body></tt>